  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support funding OSB</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Saba and Statia</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Some OSBs lack the core funding to ensure the basic functioning of the branch. This was previously part of the capacity component of the Irma program but following the closure of this program this now moved to the OD program.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support funding for some of the core costs of the OSBs such as office rent and salaries.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The smaller branches such as Saba and Statia</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Using left over funds from Irma</narrative>
  </description>
